Peace be with you, dear brothers and sisters.

In the application you will find everything that an Orthodox Christian needs every day:
- Orthodox calendar for every day;
- Lives of the saints: you can read a life for every day or find a description of the life of your saint;
- Quote, parable and thoughts of Theophan the Recluse for every day;
- Complete Bible with interpretations for each verse from the Church Fathers and. scientists;
- Prayer book with hundreds of prayers on any topic;
- News from Orthodox media, answers to questions from priests;
- Push notifications about significant dates, daily distribution of quotes from the Holy Fathers and the Bible;
- Map of Orthodox churches with history, photos and comments.

The most downloaded Orthodox app in the Appstore.

activ is not just a mobile carrier. It is cell phone service, online shop and bank – all in one super app.

Manage your tariff and services, make payments and shop, buy phones and gadgets and pay by installments in the super application from activ – one of the largest mobile providers in Kazakhstan.

Managing products and services
•	Tariff: check balance, tariff early restart, tariff fee, add-ons, airtime conversion;
•	Manage numbers of friends and family;
•	Roaming and international calls;
•	Calls/data usage details, etc.

Payments with prepaid balance
•	Top up with a bank card;
•	Transfers to local numbers and abroad;
•	Up to 30% back on bus fare;
•	Payments: utility, games, Internet and TV, tickets, parking, etc.

Online shop
•	New phone or gadget + tariff;
•	Pay by installments or purchase outright by paying the full price;
•	Delivery to 17 cities of Kazakhstan.

OGO Bank
•	Instant transfers and payments with virtual OGO Card + bonuses;
•	Consumer loans on favorable terms;
•	Deposits.
